// riso · engraved peonies, printed in cobalt; two cards laid on top.
// `stipple` is the grain of a riso print: try it on anything, even image("photo.jpg").
// `.place(x, y, w, h, radius, border)` puts any picture in a card.

peonies("mono", 1).stipple("cobalt", 1, slider(1.25, .5, 3))
sun("mono", .2).place(.1, .42, .2, .16, .012).stipple("vermilion", 1, 1.4)
grid("graph", 8).place(.1, .04, .2, .37, .012, 2)
